  "description": "Certificate of\r\nLawful Proposed Development: Replacement cladding",
  "development_type": "Certificates of Lawful Development",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The documents/information submitted, in the absence of any substantive conflicting evidence, is satisfactory to prove, on the balance of probabilities, that the proposed replacement cladding at 20-24 Canning Road would not fall within the definition of development set out in Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) as the proposed cladding would not materially affect the external appearance of the building in accordance with Section 55(2)(a)(ii) of the Act. The proposed development is therefore considered to be lawful.&lt;/p&gt;"
